  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy in the Vice Presidency, President Subianto has initiated a selection process to appoint a successor. The President requested that coalition political parties provide recommendations for the position within a one-week timeframe. While some parties have identified potential figures, including an eight-name shortlist suggested by the Golkar party, others have indicated they will defer the final decision entirely to the President. Discussions regarding the transition also involve the People's Consultative Assembly, which has been coordinating on the necessary procedures for the appointment. President Subianto stated he will conclude the selection process after completing his scheduled diplomatic visits to Manila and Shenzhen. Various political stakeholders have emphasized the importance of ensuring the appointment reflects broad consensus, with some groups advocating for candidates with specific political or institutional backgrounds to support the current administration's goals.",
